<newsitem itemid="36956" id="root" date="1996-09-06" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Masonite half year shr, div fall.</title>
<headline>Masonite half year shr, div fall.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     70	    vs 115</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 12	    vs 20</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   4.76	  vs 7.83</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   6.19	  vs 12.86</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.42	  vs 5.03</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.29	  vs 0.16 received</p>
<p>    Turnover		 94.39	  vs 89.25</p>
<p>Div payable October 11</p>
<p>on register September 20</p>
<p>Full name: Masonite (Africa) Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said local demand for hardboard was weak in the first half and export markets were also depressed.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
